# LiteLLM's master key, without which it doesn't start. Jean never holds it, and with oidc_auth.py the
# gateway takes only the sign-in's tokens. Make one with:
#   echo "LITELLM_MASTER_KEY=sk-$(openssl rand -hex 32)" >> .env
LITELLM_MASTER_KEY=

# The brain behind the gateway: any service LiteLLM reaches, by LiteLLM's name for its model.
# OpenAI, with your key:
UPSTREAM_MODEL=openai/gpt-5-mini
UPSTREAM_API_BASE=https://api.openai.com/v1
UPSTREAM_API_KEY=

# Or Ollama on this computer, with no key:
# UPSTREAM_MODEL=openai/llama3.2
# UPSTREAM_API_BASE=http://host.docker.internal:11434/v1
# UPSTREAM_API_KEY=none
